flowchart TD
    Start([Start: KnowledgeBaseManagement]) --> Input[/Input: admin_id, action_type, entry_data/]
    Input --> QUsers[(Query USERS & ROLE Tables)]
    QUsers --> CheckRole{Role == Admin OR Authorized TIC?}
    
    CheckRole -- No --> Err1[/Return Error: Unauthorized/]
    CheckRole -- Yes --> CheckAction{action_type?}
    
    CheckAction -- "Create" --> CheckData{Title/Content empty?}
    CheckData -- Yes --> Err2[/Return Error: Incomplete entry/]
    CheckData -- No --> Embed[Call GeminiAPI_GenerateEmbedding]
    Embed --> InitKB[Initialize kb_record]
    InitKB --> InsertD2[(Insert into D2: KNOWLEDGE)]
    InsertD2 --> OutCreate[/Return Success: new_kb_id/]
    
    CheckAction -- "Update" --> QUpdate[(Query D2: KNOWLEDGE)]
    QUpdate --> CheckFoundU{Entry found?}
    CheckFoundU -- No --> Err3[/Return Error: Entry not found/]
    CheckFoundU -- Yes --> CheckMod{Content modified?}
    CheckMod -- Yes --> EmbedU[Call GeminiAPI_GenerateEmbedding]
    EmbedU --> UpdateFields[Update kb_record fields]
    CheckMod -- No --> UpdateFields
    UpdateFields --> UpdateD2U[(Update D2: KNOWLEDGE)]
    UpdateD2U --> OutUpdate[/Return Success: kb_id/]
    
    CheckAction -- "Deactivate" --> QDeact[(Query D2: KNOWLEDGE)]
    QDeact --> CheckFoundD{Entry found?}
    CheckFoundD -- No --> Err3
    CheckFoundD -- Yes --> DeactFields[Set validity_status = Inactive]
    DeactFields --> UpdateD2D[(Update D2: KNOWLEDGE)]
    UpdateD2D --> OutDeact[/Return Success: kb_id/]
    
    OutCreate --> End([End])
    OutUpdate --> End
    OutDeact --> End
    Err1 --> End
    Err2 --> End
    Err3 --> End